<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-8">
            <h1 class="h3 mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>

            <div class="alert alert-warning small">
                Placeholder content — replace with a real, reviewed Privacy Policy before launch.
            </div>

            <div class="vl-card p-4">
                <h2 class="h6">1. Information We Collect</h2>
                <p class="text-muted">We collect the information you provide when registering (name, email, university) and when creating listings (title, description, photos, price, and related details).</p>

                <h2 class="h6">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
                <p class="text-muted">Your information is used to operate your account, display your listings, and allow other students to contact you about items you've listed.</p>

                <h2 class="h6">3. Sharing</h2>
                <p class="text-muted">Your name and listings are visible to other users of the platform. We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>

                <h2 class="h6">4. Data Storage</h2>
                <p class="text-muted">Account and listing data is stored using Firebase (Google Cloud) infrastructure.</p>

                <h2 class="h6">5. Your Choices</h2>
                <p class="mb-0 text-muted">You can update your profile information at any time, or contact support to request account deletion.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
